---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy | Passport Office Finder" desc="Privacy policy for passportofficefinder.com.">
<main class="wrap">
  <h1 style="font-size:1.7rem">Privacy policy</h1>
  <p class="lead">You can use this site without registering or providing any personal information.</p>
  <h2>What we don't collect</h2>
  <p>We never ask for names, passport numbers, application details or documents. The facility search runs entirely in your browser.</p>
  <h2>Technical data</h2>
  <p>Our server records standard technical logs (IP address, page, browser) for security, deleted periodically.</p>
  <h2>Advertising (Google AdSense)</h2>
  <p>We display Google AdSense ads. Google may use cookies for personalization and measurement under its policies: <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" rel="nofollow noopener">policies.google.com/technologies/ads</a>. Manage preferences at <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" rel="nofollow noopener">adssettings.google.com</a>.</p>
  <h2>Maps</h2>
  <p>Facility pages embed Google Maps (Google receives your IP when the map loads). Your location is never sent to or stored by us.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>info@passportofficefinder.com</p>
</main>
</Base>
